  FT["PH-H2569"] = {"id":"PH-H2569","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2842_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":null,"en":"An Act Changing the Name of Tatarac Community School in the Municipality of Bayambang, Province of Pangasinan, to Apalen-Tatarac Community School","orig":"An Act Changing the Name of Tatarac Community School in the Municipality of Bayambang, Province of Pangasinan, to Apalen-Tatarac Community School"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2842","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2842_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2569-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The name of Tatarac Community School in the Municipality of Bayambang, Province of Pangasinan, is hereby changed to Apalen-Tatarac Community School."}},{"id":"PH-H2569-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p36"};
  FT["PH-H2570"] = {"id":"PH-H2570","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2843_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":null,"en":"An Act Declaring Certain Places in the Municipality of La Paz, Province of Tarlac, as Duly Constituted Barrios","orig":"An Act Declaring Certain Places in the Municipality of La Paz, Province of Tarlac, as Duly Constituted Barrios"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2843","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2843_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2570-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The following places in the Municipality of La Paz, Province of Tarlac, are declared as duly constituted barrios therein, to wit:\n1. Balanoy as barrio Balanoy;\n2. Bantog-Caricutan as barrio Bantog-Caricutan,\n3. Caramutan as barrio Caramutan;\n4. Caut as barrio Caut;\n5. Gomillas as barrio Gomillas, with the sitio of Riolova as part thereof;\n6. Dumarais as barrio Dumarais;\n7. Guevara as barrio Guevara, with the sitio of Particion as part thereof;\n8. Kapanikian as barrio Kapanikian;\n9. Lara as barrio Lara;\n10. Laungcupang as barrio Laungcupang;\n11. Lomboy as barrio Lomboy, with the sitio of Mapalad as part thereof;\n12. Macalong as barrio Macalong;\n13. Matayumtayum as barrio Matayumtayum;\n14. Mayang as barrio Mayang;\n15. Motrico as barrio Motrico;\n16. Paludpud as barrio Paludpud;\n17. La Purisima (Pulongcawayan) as barrio La Purisima;\n18. San Isidro as barrio San Isidro;\n19. San Roque as barrio San Roque, with the sitio of Libtong as part thereof; and\n20. Sierra as barrio Sierra."}},{"id":"PH-H2570-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p36"};
  FT["PH-H2571"] = {"id":"PH-H2571","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2844_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":null,"en":"An Act Changing the Name of the Barrio of Pulongcawayan in the Municipality of La Paz, Province of Tarlac, to La Purisima","orig":"An Act Changing the Name of the Barrio of Pulongcawayan in the Municipality of La Paz, Province of Tarlac, to La Purisima"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2844","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2844_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2571-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The name of the barrio of Pulongcawayan in the Municipality of La Paz, Province of Tarlac, is changed to La Purisima."}},{"id":"PH-H2571-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval."}}],"pack":"ph-p36"};
  FT["PH-H2572"] = {"id":"PH-H2572","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2845_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Casiguran市","en":"An Act Creating the Barrio of Simbahan in the Municipality of Casiguran, Province of Quezon","orig":"An Act Creating the Barrio of Simbahan in the Municipality of Casiguran, Province of Quezon"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2845","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2845_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2572-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sitios of Mabudo, Simbahan, Talagas and Abulig are hereby separated from the barrio of Dinalungan in the Municipality of Casiguran, Province of Quezon, and are constituted into a distinct and independent barrio to be known as the barrio of Simbahan."}},{"id":"PH-H2572-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p36"};
  FT["PH-H2573"] = {"id":"PH-H2573","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2846_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":null,"en":"An Act Changing the Name of the Municipality of New Piñan, Province of Zamboanga del Norte, to Piñan","orig":"An Act Changing the Name of the Municipality of New Piñan, Province of Zamboanga del Norte, to Piñan"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2846","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2846_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2573-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The name of the Municipality of New Piñan in the Province of Zamboanga del Norte, is changed to Piñan."}},{"id":"PH-H2573-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p36"};
  FT["PH-H2574"] = {"id":"PH-H2574","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2847_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":null,"en":"An Act Reappropriating Certain Sums Under Title A, Title B and Title D, Section One of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen Hundred and Section Two of Same Act, and Certain Sums Under Title B, Section One of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-Three Hundred One and Section Two of the Same Act, for the Construction of the Dalanas Bridge in the Municipality of Barbaza, Province of Antique","orig":"An Act Reappropriating Certain Sums Under Title A, Title B and Title D, Section One of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen Hundred and Section Two of Same Act, and Certain Sums Under Title B, Section One of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-Three Hundred One and Section Two of the Same Act, for the Construction of the Dalanas Bridge in the Municipality of Barbaza, Province of Antique"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2847","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2847_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2574-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sum of twenty-five thousand pesos appropriated under item (27), page five, paragraph a, Title A, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen hundred; the sum of five thousand pesos appropriated under item (e), and a partial sum of one hundred thousand pesos under item (f ), both on page twenty, subparagraph five, paragraph a, Title B, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen hundred; the sum of three thousand pesos appropriated under item (j), and the sum of ten thousand pesos under item (n), both on page twenty-one, subparagraph five, paragraph a, Title B, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen hundred; the sum of seventy-five thousand pesos appropriated under item (c), page one hundred thirty-three, subparagraph five, paragraph a, Title D, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen hundred; the sum of thirty thousand pesos appropriated under item (y), and the sum of fifteen thousand pesos appropriated under item (z), both on page two hundred ten, subparagraph five, paragraph f, Section two of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen hundred; and the sum of forty thousand pesos appropriated under item (24), page three, paragraph a, Title B, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-three hundred one; and the sum of ten thousand pesos appropriated under item (e), the sum of ten thousand pesos appropriated under item (g), the sum of ten thousand pesos appropriated under item (q), and the sum of ten thousand pesos appropriated under item (s), all on page two hundred thirty-four, subparagraph five, paragraph a, Title B, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-three hundred one; and the sum of five thousand pesos appropriated under item (o) on page three hundred forty-six, subparagraph five, paragraph d, Section two of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-three hundred and one; all amounting to the total sum of three hundred forty-eight thousand pesos, are hereby reappropriated for the construction of the Dalanas Bridge in the Municipality of Barbaza, Province of Antique."}},{"id":"PH-H2574-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p36"};
  FT["PH-H2575"] = {"id":"PH-H2575","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2848_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":null,"en":"An Act to Amend Item (o), Subparagraph 5, for the Province of Antique, Page 234, Paragraph a, Title B, Section One of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-Three Hundred and One","orig":"An Act to Amend Item (o), Subparagraph 5, for the Province of Antique, Page 234, Paragraph a, Title B, Section One of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-Three Hundred and One"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2848","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2848_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2575-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Item (o), subparagraph 5, for the Province of Antique, page 234, paragraph a, Title B, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-three hundred and one is hereby amended to read as follows:\n(o) For the asphalting of Felicidad and Rizal streets, Dao ₱10,000.00.\""}},{"id":"PH-H2575-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p36"};
  FT["PH-H2576"] = {"id":"PH-H2576","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2849_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":null,"en":"An Act Appropriating Funds for Public Works","orig":"An Act Amending Certain Items of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-Three Hundred and One, Entitled “An Act Appropriating Funds for Public Works”"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2849","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2849_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。 源文条号不连续（自第 1 条起，止于第 3 条，缺 2）：经逐条比对原始页面，该处原文没有对应的 “Section N.” 抬头行，系来源页自身的编号跳跃或条文以“续段”形式并入前条，非抽取遗漏，故未擅自补号。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2576-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Item (a) on page 441, under Group II for the Province of Negros Oriental, paragraph d, Section two of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-three hundred and one is hereby amended to read as follows:\n\"(a) Lazi Municipal Building—Construction ₱30,000.00\"\nSection 2. Item No. 4 on page 587, under \"Public Buildings,\" paragraph e, Section two of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-three hundred and one is hereby amended to read as follows:\n\"4. Lazi— (a) Municipal Building ₱4,000.00\""}},{"id":"PH-H2576-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p36"};
  FT["PH-H2577"] = {"id":"PH-H2577","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2850_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":null,"en":"An Act Reappropriating Certain Sums Under Republic Acts Numbered Sixteen Hundred Thirteen, Nineteen Hundred, Twenty Hundred Ninety-Three and Twenty-Three Hundred and One for the Construction of the Cangaranan Bridge in the Municipality of Bugasong, Province of Antique.","orig":"An Act Reappropriating Certain Sums Under Republic Acts Numbered Sixteen Hundred Thirteen, Nineteen Hundred, Twenty Hundred Ninety-Three and Twenty-Three Hundred and One for the Construction of the Cangaranan Bridge in the Municipality of Bugasong, Province of Antique."},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2850","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2850_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2577-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sum of eight thousand pesos appropriated under item (i), subparagraph 4, paragraph f, Section two of Republic Act Numbered Sixteen hundred thirteen; the sum of twenty thousand pesos appropriated under item (p), the sum of nine thousand pesos appropriated under item (q), the sum of nine thousand pesos appropriated under item (r), all on page 21, subparagraph 5, paragraph a, Title B, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen hundred; the sum of fifteen thousand pesos appropriated under item (s) on page 22, subparagraph 5, paragraph a, Title B, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen hundred; the sum of five thousand pesos under item (c) on page 208, subparagraph 5, paragraph f Section two of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen hundred; the sum of forty thousand pesos appropriated under item (x) on page 210, subparagraph 5, paragraph f, Section two of Republic Act Numbered Nineteen hundred; the sum of ten thousand pesos appropriated under item on page 11, subparagraph 5, paragraph a, Title B, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Twenty hundred ninety-three; the sum of one hundred thousand pesos appropriated under item (a) on page 180, subparagraph 5 paragraph f, Title M, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Twenty hundred ninety-three; the sum of ten thousand pesos appropriated under item (l) and the sum of five thousand pesos appropriated under item (m), both on page 234, subparagraph 5, paragraph a Title B, Section one of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-throe hundred and one; the sum of three thousand pesos appropriated under item (l) and the sum of five thousand pesos appropriated under item (r) both on page 346, subparagraph 5 paragraph d, Section two of Republic Act Numbered Twenty-three hundred and one, all amounting to the total sum of two hundred thirty-nine thousand pesos, are hereby reappropriated for the construction of the Cañgaranan Bridge in the Municipality of Bugasong, Province of Antique."}},{"id":"PH-H2577-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nEnacted without Executive approval, June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p36"};
  FT["PH-H2578"] = {"id":"PH-H2578","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2851_1960.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立San Miguel市","en":"An Act Creating the Barrio of Bantog in the Municipality of San Miguel, Province of Bulacan","orig":"An Act Creating the Barrio of Bantog in the Municipality of San Miguel, Province of Bulacan"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 2851","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1960-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1960/ra_2851_1960.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2578-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sitio of Bantog in the Municipality of San Miguel, Province of Bulacan, is converted into a barrio of said municipality, to be known as the barrio of Bantog."}},{"id":"PH-H2578-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1960."}}],"pack":"ph-p36"};
